# Normalise line endings to LF. Git Bash on Windows tolerates CRLF, Linux shells (WSL2, containers
# mounting a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true) are not guaranteed to – keep scripts portable.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
# Raw e-mails keep their CRLF bytes (RFC 5322) – duplicate fingerprints hash the raw file
*.eml -text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.msg binary
